+# Dashboard Navigation Redesign - Implementation Plan
+
+> **For Claude:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task.
+
+**Goal:** Add a "Create Server" button to the dashboard header and move API Keys/SSH Keys into a "Personal" dropdown submenu, decluttering the sidebar to just Servers + Settings.
+
+**Architecture:** Pure frontend changes to React components. No routes, APIs, or backend changes. The sidebar nav items and mobile menu items are moved into Radix UI dropdown submenus already supported by the existing DropdownMenu component.
+
+**Tech Stack:** React, TypeScript, Radix UI (DropdownMenu), @gravity-ui/icons, Tailwind CSS
+
