+
+**Context:** The ellipsis dropdown currently has "Admin Panel (Staff)" and "Log Out". We add a "Personal" submenu between them containing SSH Keys and API Keys links. We also need to import the submenu components and navigation icons.
+
+**Step 1: Update imports**
